    {
      "id": "u10",
      "kind": "ANALOGY",
      "label": "Sandwich recipe analogy for limiting reactant",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "Imagine une recette de sandwich :\n\n- 2 tranches de pain + 1 tranche de fromage → 1 sandwich.\n\nSi tu as :\n\n- 10 tranches de pain,\n- 3 tranches de fromage,\n\ntu peux faire seulement 3 sandwichs. Le fromage est le **facteur limitant**.\n\nEn chimie, c’est pareil.",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {},
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "everyday",
        "evidence": [
